Due: Oct 17
ASSIGNMENT: CLEANING PHOTO COLLAGE
Make a PHOTO COLLAGE on how to properly clean and store kitchen tools and  
equipment and narrate what you have learned in the activity. Be guided by  
the following questions:
*What the things needed?
*What are the things to remember when sanitizing kitchen tools and  
equipment?
*Why is it important to sanitize kitchen tools and equipment?
*What are the appropriate safety measures in cleaning and sanitizing  
kitchen tools and equipment?

